  "mechanisms": [
    "Complete 38-function bank recovered in natural order, including every prefix, intermediate and final function. The next bytes are 11 eight-direction frame arrays.",
    "The prefix is four separately registered data rows. The native TU includes none of their logical projection arrays; it emits a typed entry pointer, minimal switch alignment and both complete compiler-owned switches.",
    "The constructor preserves the actual state/render views and branch-local frame selections. Switch fallthrough and builtin abs express the item-action state machine without any new goto.",
    "One inherited goto and the already documented owner-decision-46 dead arm in the existing 640-byte movement row remain unchanged. No new assembler, volatile, goto, pin, fake loop or raw code substitution is introduced.",
    "The two signed angle comparisons narrow the common 32-bit ABI return slot explicitly; the sibling wrapper consumes its low 16 bits arithmetically. One uniform header and stock recipe cover the entire TU."
  ],
